id: kindhearted-saiyan
name: Kindhearted Saiyan
talentCategory: racial
race: saiyan
prerequisites: Saiyan
description: >
  Thanks to your benevolent nature, your comrades benefit from your thirst for battle.
text: >
  Kindhearted Saiyan: Thanks to your benevolent nature, your comrades benefit from your thirst for battle.
  –Prerequisites: Saiyan
  (1)-[Passive]: All Allies within your Melee Range have their Soak Value increased by 1(T).
  (2)-[1/Round]: As an Instant Maneuver during an Ally’s turn, you may spend a stack of Battle Born to target that Ally. That Ally has their Combat Rolls increased by 1(T) until the start of your next turn.

---

[passive]
# (1) Read by each Ally in your Melee Range: 1(T), yours - the best of those holding it (actor-character.mjs, guidance.mjs alliesInMelee).
allow kindhearted.soak;
# (2) Its own Maneuver, on the Maneuvers tab (maneuvers/kindhearted-saiyan-second-effect.dbu).
